      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our altars become living hearts of a space, our murals radiate codes of remembrance, our décor is more than aesthetic—it is energetic. Whether intimate interiors or large-scale environments, each activation is an invitation to step into a higher vibration, to encounter the sacred in the everyday, and to experience the alchemy of space as ceremony."
